So what we are going to do is get a sense of the amount of time and energy that you essentially waste every single time you switch your attention.

5
00:00:10.682 --> 00:00:11.282
Okay, let's do this.

6
00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:11.903
All right.

7
00:00:12.043 --> 00:00:12.403
Are you ready?

8
